    "text": "Basilius se eadiga be \u00f0am we \u00e6r awriton w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e halig bisceop on Cessarean byrig on Greciscre\nHe w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e gel\u00e6red and swy\u00f0e mihtig lareow.\nAnd he munuc regol gesette mid swy\u00f0licre drohtnunge swa swa \u00fea Easternan and \u00fea Greciscean\nHe w\u00e6s \u00e6r Benedictus \u00fee us boc awrat on Ledenre spr\u00e6ce leohtre be d\u00e6le \u00f0onne Basilius ac he tymde\nBasilius awrat ane wundorlice boc be eallum Godes weorcum \u00fee he geworhte on six dagum\nAnd he awrat \u00fea lare \u00fee we nu willa\u00f0 on Englisceum gereorde secgean \u00feam he his reccea\u00f0.\nHeo gebyra\u00f0 to munecum and eac to mynecenum \u00fee regollice libba\u00f0 for hyra Drihtnes lufe under\nBasilius cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea on his boclican lare, Gehyr \u00feu min bearn, \u00f0ines f\u00e6der mynegunge and \u00fein eare ahyld\nIc wylle \u00fee secgan and so\u00f0lice l\u00e6ran \u00fe\u00e6t gastlice gewinn hu \u00feu Gode campie and mid hwilcum gemete\nGehyr \u00feu geornlice and \u00feu ne beo gehefegod mid \u00f0am sw\u00e6ran sl\u00e6pe ac awrece \u00fee sylfne mid mycelre\nNe synd \u00feas word na of me ac of Godes lare.\nNe ic mid niwre lare nelle l\u00e6ran \u00fee nu ac mid \u00fe\u00e6re lare \u00fee ic leornode gefyrn \u00e6t \u00feam halgum f\u00e6derum\nGif \u00feeos halige lar gelica\u00f0 \u00feinre heortan and gif \u00f0u hi underfehst \u00feonne f\u00e6rst \u00feu on sibbe and nan yfel\nGif \u00feu wylle campian on Godes campdome ne campa \u00feu \u00e6nigum buton Gode anum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu him\n\u00dea men \u00fee campia\u00f0 \u00feam eor\u00f0lican cininge hi gehyrsumia\u00f0 \u00e6fre eallum his h\u00e6sum.\nSwa eac \u00fea \u00fee campia\u00f0 \u00feam heofenlican cininge sceolon gehyrsumian \u00feam heofonlicum bebodum.\nSe eor\u00f0lica kempa bi\u00f0 \u00e6fre gearo and caf swa hwyder swa he faran sceal to gefeohte mid \u00feam kininge\nMycele swy\u00f0or sceal se so\u00f0a Godes cempa buton \u00e6lcere hremminge hra\u00f0e gehyrsumian Cristes\nSe eor\u00f0lica kempa kampa\u00f0 mid his w\u00e6pnum ongean gesewenlice feond and \u00feu scealt campian wi\u00f0 \u00fea\n\u00d0am woruldlican kempan is gewinn gesewenlice ongean fl\u00e6sc and blod and \u00fein gewinn is \u00e6fre\nSe woruld kempa wera\u00f0 woruldlice w\u00e6pna ongean his gelican ac \u00feu habban scealt \u00fea gastlican\nHe byr\u00f0 isenne helm and isene byrnan \u00fe\u00e6t he ne beo gewundod fram his wi\u00f0erwinnan ac beo Crist\nHe sceota\u00f0 his flan and his scearpe spere ongean his wi\u00f0erwinnan ac \u00feu witodlice scealt mid halgum\nHe ne awyrp\u00f0 nateshwon his w\u00e6pna him fram \u00e6r\u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t gewinn wur\u00f0e geendod and \u00feu ne miht\nHis feond fyht sume hwile ac \u00fein ne geswic\u00f0 n\u00e6fre swa lange swa \u00feu leofast on life mid mannum.\nHis w\u00e6pna syndon sw\u00e6re him sylfum to berenne ac Cristes geoc is wynsum and his byr\u00f0en swi\u00fee\nSe woruldcempa gecyr\u00f0 sy\u00f0\u00fean he sige gewin\u00f0 ham to his wife and to his bearnum ac \u00feu f\u00e6rst to\nHe underfeh\u00f0 gife eor\u00f0lices gestreones for his eor\u00f0lices geswinces ac \u00feu scealt underfon \u00fea\nSe munuc sceal geanbidian his edleanes \u00e6t Gode and beon him sylf \u00e6lfremed fram eor\u00f0licum d\u00e6dum\nHit is swi\u00f0e earfo\u00f0e \u00e6nigum to \u00feeowienne twam hlafordum \u00e6tg\u00e6dere Gode and woruldwelum ne he\nAc he forl\u00e6te\u00f0 Godes geoc gif he lufa\u00f0 eor\u00f0welan and his sawul bi\u00f0 gehefegod mid sw\u00e6rre byr\u00f0ene.\n\u00deus gerad man bi\u00f0 mid his agenum w\u00e6pnum yfele gewundod \u00feeah he swa ne wene and for \u00feam \u00fee he\nBesceawa \u00feu w\u00e6rlice hwilcum kininge \u00feu campast and swa micele swa se heofenlica cyning is m\u00e6rra\n\u00deu \u00feencst to gewyrcenne wundorlicne stypel and swi\u00fee healicne.\nHoga \u00feu nu for \u00fey ymbe \u00fea gastlican gestreon to \u00fe\u00e6s stypeles getimbrunge, \u00fe\u00e6t synd, \u00fea halgan\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fees stypol getimbrod mid \u00e6nigum weorcstane ac mid m\u00e6nifealdum mihtum \u00fe\u00e6s innran\nIc secge \u00fee minum bearne, beo \u00fee an foresceawung gif \u00feu Gode anum \u00feeowian gewilnast.\nNe abysga \u00feu \u00fein mod on mislicum \u00feingum ne \u00feu mid ol\u00e6ceunge \u00e6nigum gecweme ac aceorf fram \u00fee\nAdr\u00e6fe \u00e6lcne leahtor and \u00e6lcne un\u00feeaw fram \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6re sawla mihta sylf m\u00e6ge begitan.\nGehyr nu on eornost hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re sawle miht is and hwilc miht hyre begite \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste gestreon.\n\u00de\u00e6re sawle miht is \u00fe\u00e6t heo hire scyppend lufie and \u00fea \u00feing onscunie \u00fee God sylf onscuna\u00f0.\n\u00d0\u00e6re sawle miht is \u00fe\u00e6t heo sylf beo ge\u00feyldi and \u00e6lce weamodnysse fram hire awyrpe and \u00fe\u00e6t heo\n\u00d0\u00e6re sawle miht is \u00fe\u00e6t heo modinysse mycelum onscunie and ealle leasunga and lufie ea\u00f0modnysse\n\u00d0\u00e6re sawle miht is \u00fe\u00e6t heo sibbe lufie and andan and yrre \u00e6fre onscunige and dysi forbuge and\n\u00d0\u00e6re sawle miht is \u00fe\u00e6t heo sylf \u00fe\u00e6s lichaman lustas under\u00feeode \u00fe\u00e6s modes gesceade \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0as mihta \u00feu miht, min bearn, \u00fee begitan gif \u00feu woruldcara awyrpst fram \u00feinre heortan and \u00fea\nAnd gif \u00fein willa bi\u00f0 gelome abysgod on Godes herungum and \u00feu his domas asmeast \u00f0onne bist \u00feu\nLufa \u00feu, min bearn, \u00feone lifiendan God mid eallre \u00feinre mihte \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feine weorc him licion.\nGif se woruldmann kep\u00f0 hu he his wife gelikie micele swy\u00f0or sceal se munuc on eallum gemetum\nGod nele \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hine lufie mid nacodum wordum ac mid hluttre heortan and mid rihtwisum d\u00e6dum.\nSe \u00fee s\u00e6g\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he lufie \u00feone lifiendan God and his beboda ne healde\u00f0 he bi\u00f0 \u00feonne him sylf leas and\nUre f\u00e6der and modor swuncon for us hwilon and \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Godes foresceawung hyra geswinc ofer us\nNu sceolon we hi lufian be Godes sylfes lare ac swa \u00feeah swy\u00f0or we sceolon lufian God \u00fee ure\nGif ure magas willa\u00f0 us geweman fram Criste ne sceolon we for\u00fean \u00feonne hy for\u00f0farene beo\u00f0 hyra\nCrist we sceolon lufian \u00fee us alysde fram synnum.\nAnd we ne magon asecgean his wel d\u00e6da on us \u00fee us \u00feurh his drihtenlican mihte fram gedwyldum\nWe w\u00e6ron un\u00f0ancwur\u00f0e and wendon us fram Criste ac he us gesohte swa \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf ny\u00f0er astah of\nSe \u00fee belyc\u00f0 on his handa ealle \u00feas eor\u00f0an swa swa \u00e6lmihtig God and se \u00fee heofenas gehealde\u00f0\nAnd se w\u00e6s hafenleas for us se \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 ealle \u00feing \u00fe\u00e6t he us gewelgode on his eceum welum.\nAnd him w\u00e6s gedemed fram unrihtwisum demum \u00feam \u00fee on wolcnum cym\u00f0 on \u00feysre worulde ende\nAnd se \u00fee is lifes wylle he gewilnode w\u00e6teres \u00e6t \u00feam Samaritaniscean wife swa swa us s\u00e6g\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd se \u00fee ealle \u00feing afede\u00f0 se gefredde hungor \u00fea \u00fea he on \u00feam westene w\u00e6s gecostnod fram deofle\nAnd \u00feam \u00fee englas \u00feenia\u00f0 he sylf \u00feenode mannum and \u00fewoh his gingrena fet mid his f\u00e6gerum\nAnd se \u00fee fela wundra geworhte mid his handum se ge\u00feafode for us \u00fe\u00e6t man gef\u00e6stnode his handa\nAnd \u00fea \u00fea he drincan b\u00e6d \u00fea dydon \u00fea earman Judeiscean geallan to his mu\u00f0e of \u00feam mannum\nAnd se \u00fee nanum ne derede him man dyde talu and he w\u00e6s beswungen unscyldig eac for us.\nAnd se \u00fee \u00fea deadan \u00feurh his drihtenlican mihte ar\u00e6rde to life se let hine ahon on rode gealgan be his\nAnd he sy\u00f0\u00f0an w\u00e6s bebyrged ac he aras of dea\u00f0e on \u00feam \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge and he astah to heofenum to\nEall \u00feis he ge\u00ferowode for ure alysednysse \u00fe\u00e6t he forgeafe \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif us mannum.\nAnd he ne bidde\u00f0 us to edleane nanes o\u00f0res \u00feinges buton us sylfe him and ure sawla cl\u00e6ne \u00fe\u00e6t he on\nGif we nu habba\u00f0 on horde gold o\u00f0\u00f0e seolfor \u00fe\u00e6t he het us d\u00e6lan for his lufan \u00feearfum and us he\nUton geneal\u00e6cean to urum leofan Drihtne and uton us ge\u00feeodan mid godum \u00feeawum to him.\nAnd uton hine lufian and lufian us sylfe and eac ure neacstan buton \u00e6lcnum facne.\nSe \u00fee his neahstan lufa\u00f0 se gelica\u00f0 Gode and he bi\u00f0 Godes sunu geciged untwylice.\nSe \u00fee his neaxtan hata\u00f0 se bi\u00f0 gehaten \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s awyrgedan deofles bearn \u00fee wyle \u00e6fre \u00fewyres.\nSe \u00fee his bro\u00f0or lufa\u00f0 he leofa\u00f0 on sibbe and se \u00fee his bro\u00f0or hata\u00f0 he h\u00e6f\u00f0 unstilnesse and swy\u00f0e\nSe wellwillenda man wyle ea\u00f0e forberan gif hine man ahw\u00e6r tyn\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e him tale gecwy\u00f0 and se\nSe \u00fee mid lufe bi\u00f0 afylled se f\u00e6r\u00f0 on smyltnesse and se \u00fee hatunge h\u00e6f\u00f0 se f\u00e6r\u00f0 mid yrsunge.\nLufa \u00feu, min bearn, on \u00feinum life simle wellwyllendnysse \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gewilnie godes and hafa \u00f0inne\nL\u00e6t \u00fee \u00e6lcne mannan \u00fee geleafan h\u00e6f\u00f0 to Gode swa leofne swa bro\u00f0or and beo \u00fee sylf gemyndig \u00fe\u00e6t\nNe astyra \u00feu \u00e6swicunga \u00e6nigum men on life and \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee sylfum mislica\u00f0 ne do \u00feu o\u00f0rum mannum \u00feat.\nGif \u00feu hwene gesihst ge\u00feeon on gode blissa on his d\u00e6dum \u00fe\u00e6t his bliss beo \u00fein and gif him hw\u00e6t\nAdr\u00e6f fram \u00feinre sawle \u00e6lce yfelnysse and seo hatung ne ontende \u00f0ine heortan nates hwon.\nNe astyra \u00feu yrsunga \u00feinum under\u00feeoddum ne ummihtigum men \u00feeah \u00fee \u00feu m\u00e6ge bet ac hafa hine\nNe lufa \u00feu \u00feinne bro\u00f0or mid gehiwodre heortan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hine kysse and kepe him hearmes for\u00feam \u00fee\nOn swilcum d\u00e6dum se so\u00f0a God by\u00f0 gegremed so\u00f0lice.\n\u00de\u00e6t hluttre mod \u00fee Gode gelica\u00f0 forsih\u00f0 \u00fea hiwunga and healt so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse.\nDo \u00feu feorr fram \u00fee \u00fea fakenfullan hiwunge and ne kep \u00feu nates hwon \u00feinum niextan facnes ne \u00feu\nTala \u00fee \u00feinne bro\u00f0or swilce he beo \u00fein lim.\nGif \u00feu hwilon yrsie swa swa o\u00f0re men do\u00f0 ne l\u00e6t \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t yrre licgean on \u00feinre heortan ofer sunnan\nSe man \u00fee sibbe lufa\u00f0 he sylf gearca\u00f0 Criste wununge on his mode for\u00feam \u00fee Crist sylf is sibb and he\nCrist onscuna\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00feone andigendan wer and se gesibsuma wer by\u00f0 on smyltnesse a.\nSe ni\u00f0fulla wer bi\u00f0 gelic \u00feam scipe \u00fee \u00fea y\u00f0a drifa\u00f0 ut on s\u00e6 swa hu swa se wind bl\u00e6w\u00f0 buton \u00e6lcum\nEft se ni\u00f0fulla wer by\u00f0 \u00feam wulfe gelic \u00fee wo\u00f0lice abite\u00f0 \u00fea bilewitan sceap and se gesibsuma wer\n\u00d0\u00e6s ni\u00f0fullan mannes weorc by\u00f0 on w\u00e6dlunge \u00e6fre and swa se gesibsuma wer swy\u00f0or blissa\u00f0 on\nSe gesibsuma man so\u00f0lice by\u00f0 oncnawen \u00feurh his modes blisse and on gl\u00e6dum andwlitan and se\nSe gesibsuma mann h\u00e6f\u00f0 him sylf gemanan mid \u00feam halgum englum and se ni\u00f0fulla by\u00f0 deofla\nAwend \u00feine eagan fram yfelre gesih\u00f0e and ne gelustfulla \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu mid fulre lufe sceawie wlitigra\nGemun \u00feu, min bearn, hwam \u00feu gehalgodest \u00feine agene lima and ne l\u00e6t \u00feu nates hwon hi beon\nAwend \u00feine lufe fram wifmanna lufe \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00fee hire lufu \u00fee beluce fram Criste.\nNe forseoh \u00feu nates hwon \u00fea ly